\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认新一代旗舰模型 Gemini 4 已进入后训练阶段，有望远早于年底推出</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind负责人科拉伊·卡武克奥卢在AI Agenda Live峰会上确认，新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练初期阶段，有望远早于年底发布。谷歌决定跳过Gemini 3.5 Pro，将研发重心全面转向Gemini 4。目前，该模型已在谷歌内部用于Antigravity AI编程工具，并同步进行防护机制开发与安全测试。卡武克奥卢表示，团队对早期测试结果感到振奋，未来将保持快速迭代。此前谷歌曾发布Gemini 3.1及多款Flash系列模型，此次Gemini 4作为自Gemini 3系列后的首款下一代旗舰，旨在通过强化后训练提升模型行为的可靠性。针对行业竞争，谷歌强调当前核心目标是构建值得信任的智能体，而非单纯讨论AGI的实现。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a4bff8a49fa33f8572fdc481f881ca00.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202646智元把具身智能的产能刻度又往前推了一大格。9月24日，第20000台通用具身智能机器人远征A3Ultra在横琴长隆飞船乐园正式走下产线，并当场交到长隆集团手里。从今年3月跨过万台门槛到如今的两万台，这家公司只用了约6个月——产能爬坡的曲线，已经明显进入了加速段。同一天，由智元与长隆联手打造的全球首个大规模具身智能主题乐园在横琴长隆飞船乐园启幕，超过300台智元全系机器人开始在园区里常态化上岗，扎进游客互动、导览、演艺和科普研学等场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端上线语音智能体功能，支持语音指令执行任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd51c491a1a376446f6771e9bdc289bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日宣布ChatGPT移动端新增基于语音的智能体功能，用户通过语音指令即可完成文档撰写、邮件总结及Slack消息处理等任务。该功能将语音交互从传统的问答模式升级为端到端的任务执行。Pro和Plus订阅用户可利用该智能体创建文档、制作PPT、构建网站及调用云端浏览器；Free和Go订阅用户则可通过插件连接应用使用。此外，Plus用户可在文本与语音间无缝切换，并支持跨设备协同，实现手机端处理工作后在电脑端无缝衔接。此次更新标志着ChatGPT在移动端生产力场景的进一步深化，通过语音交互直接驱动复杂任务的自动化执行，显著提升了移动办公的交互效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布多款AI眼镜及Muse智能体，Muse全面接入硬件生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0596dd329feb9582c2f0b2e7dba946d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在Connect大会发布多款AI硬件，核心智能体Muse全面接入智能眼镜。硬件方面，Meta推出无摄像头版Ray-Ban Meta Audio Glasses（349美元，续航12小时）及Ray-Ban Meta Gen 3（449美元，1200万像素摄像头）。此外，轻量级Meta VR Glasses将于2027年春季上市，起售价1299美元；独立终端Muse Charm预计年底推出。软件层面，Muse已接入眼镜，支持语音交互、环境理解及购物辅助，并拥有专属邮箱及Mac端操作能力。扎克伯格表示，Muse未来将通过交易实现商业化。Meta还计划为眼镜增加听力增强功能。截至9月21日，Muse已登顶美区App Store与Google Play免费榜。此次发布标志着Meta正将AI、智能眼镜与VR硬件深度</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek年化收入突破10亿美元，拟募资500亿元冲刺上交所上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58f6242907fbe1a7a1c35a2eb3f7b308.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek年化收入已突破10亿美元大关，较数月前实现翻倍增长，公司正筹备在上海证券交易所上市。首席执行官梁文峰在投资者会议上披露，业绩增长主要得益于产品定价上调及模型在开发者与企业端的采用率攀升。DeepSeek目前正进行第二轮融资，计划在10月底前完成500亿元人民币的募资，投后估值预计达5000亿元人民币。此次融资与上市计划不仅印证了其大模型技术的商业落地能力，更创下国内大模型初创企业一级市场资本规模新纪录。在生成式AI商业化面临盈利审视的背景下，DeepSeek的财务表现与资本运作对本土AI企业冲刺公开资本市场具有重要的风向标意义。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
